Subject: [PATCH 4/7] feat(launcher): package and run the linux launcher on
 arm64

The desktop launcher picks the linux-arm64 setup platform and build
preset on an ARM64 Linux device, updates from the linux-arm64 release
archive, and package-launcher.py publishes that archive with
--platform linux-arm64.
---
